# Allowlist: the images are built from the project metadata, the sources and the
# API entrypoint only. Everything else (.env, .git, .venv, tests, generated/,
# evidence/, local caches) stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src/
!scripts/api-entrypoint.sh

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
